#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The backup suffix is '~', unless set with B<--suffix> or "
"SIMPLE_BACKUP_SUFFIX.  The version control method may be selected via the "
"B<--backup> option or through the VERSION_CONTROL environment variable.  "
"Here are the values:"
msgstr ""
"Suffikset for sikkerhedskopiering er \"~\", med mindre andet er angivet med "
"B<--suffix> eller SIMPLE_BACKUP_SUFFIX. Versionsstyringsmetoden kan vælges "
"med flaget B<--backup> eller vha. miljøvariabelen VERSION_CONTROL. Gyldige "
"værdier er:"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
